  DisplayName: Eternal Blessing
  Description: Makes a persistent buff stronger and easier to maintain. Consumes tower capacity and limits other buffs. Supported Skills have no Reservation Supported Skills also count as Blessing SkillsYou can only have one Aura on you from your Blessing Skills Your Non-Blessing Skills which Reserve Mana are Disabled while you have an Aura from a Supported Skill on you
